node v22.22.1, Linux x64; undici 7.27.2 / 7.28.0 / 8.6.0 from npm

## Additional context

Related merged work touching the same code path: #5397 / #5402 / #5407 / #5409 (fake-timer interop), #5400 (fresh-socket guard, v6.x backport).


